      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC DEUCE (1) could manage only second at this track last time but turned heads when clocking a slick 19.86 over 366m at this track the start prior. Rates on top and can find winning form again. SNACK DRAGON (8) scored an on-pace win two back then gave a start and could manage only 7th at this track (20.13) last time. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Should be about the money. ZIPPING ALCARAZ (3) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at Q Parklands over 520m behind Canya Break Even (30.88) in a Restricted WIN. Has never been out of the placings from three starts out of this box. Likely to be thereabouts. HARA'S QUEEN (4) deserves plenty of thought over this journey.",
